  "content": "<p>JEI/EMI 考古學附加元件</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組新增了能用於檢視嗅探獸可挖掘物品的視圖，以及能在可疑的沙子和礫石中發現的物品視圖。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8drp9J9NKE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 連結</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/698/260/2023-07-20-21_05_26-window.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"891\" height=\"838\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/698/261/2023-07-20-21_06_02-window.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"886\" height=\"836\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252flobstermods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jonn.dk/akliz_banner_archaeology.png\" alt=\"贊助商時間\" width=\"830\" height=\"200\"></a></p>",
